  "label": "User projected onto the scene of a local market",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the overall scene depicted in the image, which includes the vendor, customers, ice cream cones, Turkish flag, and the text overlay 'a local market'. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'me', 'you', or 'your...' in the image. The projection is implicit and contextual, as the user is invited to perceive themselves as an observer or participant in the cultural experience being documented — a slice of everyday life in a Turkish local market. The scene itself, as a whole, serves as the projected entity.",
